      "subjectPrerequisites": {"status":"partial","items":["Not used in Altiora’s matching yet — see the note for the official guidance"],"codes":[],"sources":[{"url":"https://admissions.cornell.edu/first-year-arts-sciences-applicants","label":"Cornell: First-Year Arts & Sciences Applicants"}],"lastVerified":"2026-10-19","sourceSnippet":"A&S seeks students who maintain a rigorous high school curriculum and demonstrate a strong record of academic achievement. … Required Courses … 4 units of English … 3 units of mathematics (including pre-calculus) … An additional unit of advanced math is recommended … 3 units of science … An additional unit of advanced science is recommended … 3 units of one foreign language*","note":"Official: College of Arts & Sciences required courses — 4 units of English; 3 units of mathematics (including pre-calculus), an additional unit of advanced math recommended; 3 units of science, an additional unit of advanced science recommended; 3 units of one foreign language (heritage speakers or students who began the language before high school: at least the third level). This major is applied to through the College of Arts & Sciences.","reviewFlag":"Official source lists required high-school courses for the College of Arts & Sciences (English 4, maths 3 incl. pre-calculus, science 3, one foreign language 3); data/courseRequirements.js holds none. Owner decision."},
